# The M2-17 determinism baseline is a byte-for-byte artefact: LF on every platform, so a one-hash
# change diffs as one line rather than as a whole-file rewrite, and so the file stays identical on
# whichever runtime reads it. Same rule as Rng/.gitattributes and Model/Snapshots/.gitattributes.
#
# The off-host reader would be M5-12's determinism job (Linux x64 + Android ARM64; the iOS ARM64 leg
# is authored but gated off with iOS itself, `16` D34). ⚠️ That job is `if: false` in ci.yml and its
# tracker row does not name this table yet — see `18` §11.1. LF is worth pinning regardless.
*.json text eol=lf
